   digital history game learning. A partial least squares (PLS) technique
   applied to verify that intention to usedigital gameswas directly
   influenced by students' game preferences and epistemological beliefs.
   Therefore, educators should recognize and enhance students'
   epistemological beliefs when implementing the game-based learning, and
   increasestudents' game learning effectiveness.},
